  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "S001",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 24.48,
      "text": "大家好,今天是2026年8月11号,星期二,这是我们多摩台媒体助手寂寞项目的第三次碰头,我是吴冬任,负责这次的记录,今天要勾四件事,第一是转录管线的进展,第二是结构和分析和检索,第三是工具Agent的设计,第四是多语言课程和提交时间。",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S002",
      "start": 38.48,
      "end": 47.48,
      "text": "Let's start with part one, the transcription pipeline, Chen Zhiyuan got Whisper Large B3 Turbo running on Collab last Thursday on our 5-minute 40-second test recording.It produced 47 timestamped segments, and the whole transcription took about 50 seconds on a T4.",
      "language": "english",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S003",
      "start": 47.48,
      "end": 57.48,
      "text": "We check the segment boundaries by hand, and only 3 of them we split at an awkward place, which is good enough for the chunking we want to do later.",
      "language": "english",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S004",
      "start": 57.48,
      "end": 64.48,
      "text": "第二部分和第三部分是我做的,结构和分析这块,我让模型一样的复习成。",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S005",
      "start": 64.48,
      "end": 67.48,
      "text": "8个必须自断,都要较硬。",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S006",
      "start": 67.48,
      "end": 76.48,
      "text": "列表自断必须是真的列表,第一版大概有五分之一的概率会在JSON外面做出一段解释文字,我加了从事,最多从事两次。",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S007",
      "start": 76.48,
      "end": 78.48,
      "text": "现在基本稳定了",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S008",
      "start": 78.48,
      "end": 81.48,
      "text": "检索这边,我按30秒左右一块来接",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S009",
      "start": 81.48,
      "end": 84.48,
      "text": "整段录音一共,切出19个chunk",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S010",
      "start": 84.48,
      "end": 89.48,
      "text": "我们用其签问embedding 0.6b 测了12个跨语言查询",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S011",
      "start": 89.48,
      "end": 93.48,
      "text": "有10个在头3里,令中了正确的频段",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S012",
      "start": 93.48,
      "end": 95.48,
      "text": "这个结果我觉得可以接受",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S013",
      "start": 95.48,
      "end": 123.48,
      "text": "Now part for the agent, Ryanair is building a tool loop, we have three tools so far, search transcript, count dimensions, and get media metadata, the loop is kept at 5 steps, and an unknown tool name returns an error observation instead of crashing the whole run, one thing worth recording, the T4 only has 16GB of memory,",
      "language": "english",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S014",
      "start": 123.48,
      "end": 132.48,
      "text": "So we have to delete the whisper model and empty the CUDA card before we load the language and model.",
      "language": "english",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S015",
      "start": 132.48,
      "end": 138.48,
      "text": "Don't hit an out of memory error twice before we figure it out.",
      "language": "english",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S016",
      "start": 138.48,
      "end": 143.48,
      "text": "第五部分我们选的是Ocean C,多语言模式,不做整列识别。",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S017",
      "start": 143.48,
      "end": 148.48,
      "text": "我们的测试录音本身就是中音调替的,所以要保留人文转录,",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S018",
      "start": 148.48,
      "end": 152.32,
      "text": "还单独生产一份英文翻译,两份都要存下来",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S019",
      "start": 152.32,
      "end": 154.88,
      "text": "乱记了一个我觉得很好的点",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S020",
      "start": 154.88,
      "end": 158.88,
      "text": "我要用同一段文字既做检索又做翻译展示",
      "language": "chinese",
      "language_file_level": "chinese"
    },
    {
      "id": "S021",
      "start": 158.88,
      "end": 162.48,
      "text": "容易混淆,应该在数据结构里分两个字段",
